sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin as Admin
    participant UI as Workbench UI
    participant Hooks as React Query hooks
    participant WPAPI as WP REST proxy
    participant RecSvc as Recognition Service

    Note over Admin,RecSvc: Phase 1 - Scan identities
    Admin->>UI: Select media rows
    UI->>Hooks: useScanIdentities.mutate(mediaIds)
    Hooks->>WPAPI: POST /recognition/analyze {media_ids:[...]}
    WPAPI->>RecSvc: /recognition/analyze
    RecSvc-->>WPAPI: {job_ids:[uuid]}
    WPAPI-->>Hooks: AnalyzeResponse
    Hooks->>Hooks: remember job_ids in useRecognitionJobHistory

    Note over Hooks,RecSvc: Phase 2 - Poll job status
    loop every 1.5s while pending
        Hooks->>WPAPI: GET /recognition/jobs/{job_id}
        WPAPI->>RecSvc: /recognition/jobs/{job_id}
        RecSvc-->>WPAPI: {status:"running"|"completed"|"failed"}
        WPAPI-->>Hooks: ScanStatus
    end
    Hooks->>UI: show status text / errors

    Note over Admin,RecSvc: Phase 3 - Cluster identities
    Admin->>UI: Click "Cluster identities"
    UI->>Hooks: useClusterIdentities.mutate()
    Hooks->>WPAPI: POST /recognition/clustering/jobs
    WPAPI->>RecSvc: /recognition/clustering/jobs
    RecSvc-->>WPAPI: {status:"complete"|pending,...}
    WPAPI-->>Hooks: ClusterResponse
    Hooks->>Hooks: invalidate queries ['media-identities','recognition-clusters']

    Note over Admin,RecSvc: Phase 4 - Review clusters + suggestions
    UI->>Hooks: useRecognitionClusters()
    Hooks->>WPAPI: GET /recognition/clusters
    WPAPI->>RecSvc: /recognition/clusters
    RecSvc-->>WPAPI: ClusterSummary[]
    WPAPI-->>Hooks: cache clusters

    UI->>Hooks: useClusterSuggestions(identityId)
    Hooks->>WPAPI: GET /recognition/identities/{id}/suggestions
    WPAPI->>RecSvc: /recognition/identities/{id}/suggestions
    RecSvc-->>WPAPI: {matches:[...]}
    WPAPI-->>Hooks: suggestions

    Note over Admin,RecSvc: Phase 5 - Persist decisions
    Admin->>UI: Accept suggestion / relabel / merge / split
    UI->>WPAPI: POST /recognition/suggestions/{id}/accept | PATCH /recognition/clusters/{id}
    WPAPI->>RecSvc: mutate suggestion or cluster
    RecSvc-->>WPAPI: success
    WPAPI-->>Hooks: invalidate ['recognition-clusters','identity-suggestions']
